Basic Commands
⚫1- add - adds new or changed files in your working directory to the Git staging area.
        git add <- file name ->

⚫2- commit - it is the record of change
        git commit -m "some message"

⚫3- push - upload local repo content to remote repo
        git push origin main



Note:   Modify > Add > Commit(final change) ;
Note:  Directly Add karne ke liye haam (git add .) likh dete hai sari files add ho jati hai ek sath theek hai na